==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Alternative forms===
* [[guerilla]]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|es|en}} {{term|guerrilla|lang=es}}, diminutive of {{term|guerra||war|lang=es}}, coined during the {{w|Peninsular war}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ɡəˈɹɪlə/|lang=en}}
* {{homophones|lang=en|gorilla}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|now|_|rare|lang=en}} A non-official war carried out by small independent groups; a [[guerrilla war]].
# A [[soldier]] in a small independent group, fighting against the government or regular forces by [[surprise]] [[raid]]s.

